BaseClaimPolicy::getQualificationRules
├── given not initialized
│   └── it should return empty struct
├── given initialized
│   ├── it should return rules for configured chainId/arbiter
│   ├── it should return empty struct for unconfigured chainId
│   ├── it should return empty struct for unconfigured arbiter
│   └── it should return useArbiterHash flag
└── given multiple chainId/arbiter pairs
    └── it should return correct rules per pair